# Escondite Vertice, B2F (villain hideout B2F, C4b, contract 41), 14 x 16, interior. Same pieces as B1F, another field of nine platforms and belts (the stairs from B1F arrive at the top right (door (12,2)), the way down is
# the top left (door (2,2)), eight platform hops apart). Three grunts, the elevator panel in the middle platform (B1F / B2F / B4F), items in the corners.
@map escondite_2
@size 14 16
@interior yes
@area escondite_vertice
@bg 3
@fill metal_00
@spawn up 12 3 S
@spawn down 2 3 S
@spawn lift 7 10 NE
@legend
